warning[L018]: 'final_step' does not select the last point
   --> /event_or.va:21:9
   |
21 |         @(initial_step, final_step) state = 0.0;
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ body is evaluated unconditionally
   |
   = nothing in OSDI tells a model which point is the last one, so the event cannot be scheduled
   = an analysis list is honoured, so the body is confined to the analyses it names, but runs at every evaluation of them
   = help: a file does not need closing for what was written to it to arrive, and '$fclose' here closes it on the first evaluation
   = unscheduled_event is set to warn by default

